--[[
KNOWN HANGOUT V1
Client-side Roblox QoL hub. Built from the supplied Known GFX / Saiki Rechat
references and the Kronos YouTube Music Session design.

V1 status:
  * Core UI, mobile scaling, navigation, graphics, environment and performance
    controls are implemented locally.
  * Firebase connection fields are intentionally blank. Add the NEW project's
    Firebase Web API keys before enabling chat/DM/music network operations.
  * Chat/DM and synchronized music panels are V1 interface/integration shells;
    they are not advertised as connected until the matching Firebase rules and
    trusted identity flow are configured.
  * No YouTube-to-MP3 downloading is implemented. The referenced Kronos system
    streams through an external engine; its remote loadstring is not executed here.

Executor compatibility: request or http_request is needed for future Firebase
integration. This file uses ordinary Roblox client APIs for its active modules.
]]

